68179\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/48e967802c356191fd7785082fbfd103?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"joelaw\" data-uid=\"556539\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>5</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>其实就是代码的搬运工。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18268192\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/054e/d913/374193_normal.png?m=1782802581\" alt=\"GyroZeppeli13\" data-uid=\"374193\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>6</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>六年前，V 站程序员批判 GPT3 那种勃勃生机，万物竞发的境界犹在眼前。短短六年，大模型竟然一变而为程序员的葬身之地了吗？不论怎么讲，人脑参数量 vs 大模型参数量，是 1000 亿对 100000 亿，优势在我！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18268295\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bab0fb1a31b380d144c497aab6398c84?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"noahjsn\" data-uid=\"786171\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>7</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>利好非技术工作。铁人三项 yyds ！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18268303\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/034d/526a/619444_normal.png?m=1761963935\" alt=\"evan9527\" data-uid=\"619444\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>8</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>科技的进步注定要牺牲一批人，技术不是不存在了，是变成了另一种存在形式。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18268344\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/91e5/1471/637573_normal.png?m=1746043098\" alt=\"passive\" data-uid=\"637573\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>9</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>只是门槛低的 IT 技术被优化了而已。还有许多非常 niche 的技术，大语言模型没见过，核心代码的抽卡/拉锯的效率远不如手撮，AI 只能用来补全 boilerplate 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18268391\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3da6/bca1/579014_normal.png?m=1655454180\" alt=\"xubeiyou\" data-uid=\"579014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                    \n                    <p><span>11</span></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <p>也不是- - 得看公司吧 很多人还是不懂这部分内容的  还是需要对接的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18268717\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1203/d5ab/468467_normal.png?m=1765818143\" alt=\"Pending\" data-uid=\"468467\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td>\n                    <div>\n                   